                          %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} p
                  (
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2103.06666"}> arXiv:2103.06666
                  )
            %p
              The generalization to
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/pp-wave+spacetimes"} pp-wave spacetimes
              (leading to the
              = succeed "):" do
